From 66c6c3d3f5dd22b47b88d87d7be225affc76eef6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Sep 2024 23:41:23 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 144/157] net: ethernet: renesas: rswitch: introduce
 rswitch_route_monitor

Decouple route monitoring and l3 rule creation from rswitch_device,
in preparation to use it also for virtual ports.

Also will be useful for future implementation of l3 offload to bridged
ports.

Signed-off-by: Nikita Yushchenko <nikita.yoush@cogentembedded.com>

diff --git a/drivers/net/ethernet/renesas/rswitch.c b/drivers/net/ethernet/renesas/rswitch.c
index f968518c7d80..c5b824471110 100644
--- a/drivers/net/ethernet/renesas/rswitch.c
+++ b/drivers/net/ethernet/renesas/rswitch.c
